  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "grid",
      "column_span": 1,
      "cards": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "heading": "Automatic climate",
          "icon": "mdi:thermostat-auto",
          "badges": [
            {
              "type": "entity",
              "entity": "input_boolean.climate_auto",
              "name": "Auto",
              "show_state": true,
              "color": "green"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text_only": true,
          "content": "{% set night = is_state('schedule.climate_night','on') or is_state('alarm_control_panel.home','armed_night') %}{% set away = is_state('alarm_control_panel.home','armed_away') and (now() - states.alarm_control_panel.home.last_changed).total_seconds() > 1800 %}{% set o = states('sensor.house_temperature') | float(-999) %}{% set hbo = states('input_number.climate_heat_below_outdoor') | float(17) %}{% set cao = states('input_number.climate_cool_above_outdoor') | float(20) %}{% set hm = states('input_select.climate_house_mode') %}{% if o <= -900 %}{% set house = 'Unknown - outdoor sensor unavailable' %}{% elif hm == 'heat' %}{% set house = 'HEATING' %}{% elif hm == 'cool' %}{% set house = 'COOLING' %}{% else %}{% set house = 'SHOULDER - neither' %}{% endif %}### House: {{ house }}\n\n{{ '**Away** - safety band only' if away else ('**Night** targets' if night else '**Day** targets') }} · outdoor {{ '-' if o <= -900 else (o | round(1) ~ '°') }} · heat below {{ hbo }}° / cool above {{ cao }}°{% if o > -900 and states('input_select.climate_house_mode') == 'shoulder' %}\n\nOutdoor sits in the shoulder band, so no room will heat or cool. Rooms with **air filter** on run the fan only.{% endif %}{% if is_state('input_boolean.climate_auto','off') %}\n\n⚠️ **Automation is OFF** - comfort control is not running.{% set nsf = namespace(fon=[]) %}{% for n, s in [('Living room','living_room'),('Office','office'),('Bedroom','bedroom'),('Kids room 1','kid1'),('Kids room 2','kid2')] %}{% if is_state('input_boolean.climate_air_filter_' ~ s,'on') %}{% set nsf.fon = nsf.fon + [n] %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% if nsf.fon %} **Air filter is on in {{ nsf.fon | join(', ') }} and is doing nothing** - the filter needs automatic control to be on.{% endif %}{% if is_state('input_boolean.climate_safety_always','on') %} Safety limits still apply.{% endif %}{% endif %}{% if is_state('input_boolean.climate_safety_always','off') %}\n\n⚠️ **Safety limits are OFF** - no frost protection and no away band.{% endif %}"
        },
        {
          "type": "tile",
          "entity": "input_boolean.climate_auto",
          "name": "Automatic climate control",
          "color": "green",
          "grid_options": {
            "columns": 12
          },
          "features": [
            {
              "type": "toggle"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text_only": true,
          "content": "{% set ns2 = namespace(dead=[], m6=[]) %}{% set rr = [('Living room','living_room'),('Office','office'),('Bedroom','bedroom'),('Kids room 1','kid1'),('Kids room 2','kid2')] %}{% for n, s in rr %}{% if states('sensor.climate_temp_' ~ s) in ['unknown','unavailable'] and (now() - states['sensor.climate_temp_' ~ s].last_changed).total_seconds() > 600 %}{% set ns2.dead = ns2.dead + [n] %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% set night = is_state('schedule.climate_night','on') or is_state('alarm_control_panel.home','armed_night') %}{% for n, s, tw in [('Bedroom','bedroom','climate.bedroom_trv_bedroom_trv'),('Kids room 1','kid1','climate.kid1_room_trv_kid1_room_trv'),('Kids room 2','kid2','climate.kid2_room_trv_kid2_room_trv')] %}{% set sp = state_attr(tw,'temperature') | float(0) %}{% set at = (states('input_number.climate_target_night_' ~ s) if night else states('input_number.climate_target_day_' ~ s)) | float(20) %}{% if sp > at %}{% set ns2.m6 = ns2.m6 + [n] %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% set tv = states('input_number.climate_trv_sensor_offset') | float(0) %}{% set aco = states('input_number.climate_ac_sensor_offset') | float(-2) %}{% set upt = now().timestamp() - (state_attr('input_datetime.climate_ha_started','timestamp') | float(0)) %}{% if ns2.dead %}🛰️ **No temperature reading: {{ ns2.dead | join(', ') }}** — the safety band cannot be checked in {{ 'that room' if ns2.dead | count == 1 else 'those rooms' }}.\n\n{% endif %}{% if (tv | abs) > 3 or aco < -3.5 %}⚠️ **Sensor calibration looks wrong** — rooms may be reading several degrees off. The affected sensors are being ignored in favour of their backups.\n\n{% endif %}{% if ns2.m6 %}♨️ **Radiator valve set above target: {{ ns2.m6 | join(', ') }}** — the boiler and the AC will take turns.\n\n{% endif %}{% if upt > 34560000 %}⚠️ **Restart stamp is stale** — the guard that tells a person at the wall from a faulty unit is inert.\n\n{% endif %}{% set b = states('input_number.climate_breaker_threshold') | int(3) %}{% set rooms = [('Living room','counter.climate_fail_living_room','input_datetime.climate_manual_until_living_room'),('Office','counter.climate_fail_office','input_datetime.climate_manual_until_office'),('Bedroom','counter.climate_fail_bedroom','input_datetime.climate_manual_until_bedroom'),('Kids room 1','counter.climate_fail_kid1','input_datetime.climate_manual_until_kid1'),('Kids room 2','counter.climate_fail_kid2','input_datetime.climate_manual_until_kid2')] %}{% set ns = namespace(bad=[], held=[]) %}{% for n, c, m in rooms %}{% if states(c) | int(0) >= b %}{% set ns.bad = ns.bad + [n] %}{% endif %}{% set t = state_attr(m,'timestamp') %}{% if t and now().timestamp() < t %}{% set ns.held = ns.held + [n] %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% set hbo = states('input_number.climate_heat_below_outdoor') | float(17) %}{% set cao = states('input_number.climate_cool_above_outdoor') | float(20) %}{% if ns.bad %}🔌 **Not responding: {{ ns.bad | join(', ') }}** — comfort throttled, safety still running.\n\n{% endif %}{% if ns.held %}✋ **Manual hold: {{ ns.held | join(', ') }}** — automation hands off until it expires.\n\n{% endif %}{% if hbo >= cao %}⚠️ **House band inverted** ({{ hbo }} / {{ cao }}) — all comfort control is stood down.\n\n{% endif %}{% if is_state('input_boolean.climate_safety_always','off') %}⚠️ **Safety limits are OFF** — no frost protection, no away band.\n\n{% endif %}{% if not ns.bad and not ns.held and hbo < cao and is_state('input_boolean.climate_safety_always','on') %}All five units responding · no manual holds · safety limits on.{% endif %}"
        },
